> Here is a paper on adaptation in flooding:
> ```
> Budgets in high water? Fiscal implications of
> flood adaptation in the United Kingdom
> Alexandra Lehner ∗1, Nina Knittel1, Eva Preinfalk1, Birgit Bednar-Friedl1,2
> and Paul Watkiss3
> 1University of Graz, Wegener Center for Climate and Global Change, Brandhofgasse 5, 8010 Graz,
