> 4 Results
> This section presents the results of the macroeconomic analysis for the low warming
> scenarioin2030andthehighwarmingscenarioin2050. Thebaselinedevelopmentwithout
> climate change impacts and adaptation serves as a reference for comparison. Results
> are reported in absolute (million USD) or relative (%) differences between the baseline
