> 4.2 GDP effects
> From a public sector perspective, not only fiscal sustainability matters but also macroe-
> conomic performance, as measured by GDP. Figure 5 therefore shows differences in GDP
> of the impact and adaptation scenarios compared to the baseline. In the impact scenario,
> GDP losses arise due to capital destruction and productivity losses, which are connected
